Error [E0328]: value alternates mixed with `&&` without grouping parentheses
  --> tests/ui/matcharm_mixing_needs_parens.jet:5:19
    |
  5 |         400 | 404 && fresh -> { return "retry" }
    |                   ^^
 Why: `|` and `&&` at the same arm-head level are ambiguous to read (D-MATCHARM2)
 Fix: group the alternates: `(400 | 404) && condition` instead of `400 | 404 && condition`
